{"step_index":2051,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-03T08:39:48Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-03T14:09:48+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-03T14:09:48+05:30\nShowing lines 450-600 of 902\n450:                 Presumptive (Sec 44AD)\n451:               </button>\n452:               <button \n453:                 type=\"button\"\n454:                 id=\"btn-ledger-mode-regular\"\n455:                 class=\"py-2 px-3 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold transition-all text-center ${\n456:                   calcMode === 'REGULAR' \n457:                     ? 'bg-white text-indigo-700 shadow-sm border border-slate-200' \n458:                     : 'text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900'\n459:                 }\"\n460:               >\n461:                 Normal P&L (ITR-3)\n462:               </button>\n463:             </div>\n464:           </div>\n465:         </div>\n466: \n467:         <!-- MODE SPECIFIC INPUTS -->\n468:         ${calcMode === '44AD' ? `\n469:           <!-- SEC 44AD PRESUMPTIVE ENGINE -->\n470:           <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-purple-50/50 border border-purple-200 space-y-4\">\n471:             <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs\">\n472:               <span class=\"font-bold text-purple-900\">Digital / UPI Receipts Ratio:</span>\n473:               <span class=\"font-mono font-bold text-purple-700\">\n474:                 ${digitalShare}% Digital (UPI/Bank) • ${cashShare}% Cash\n475:               </span>\n476:             </div>\n477: \n478:             <!-- Slider -->\n479:             <input \n480:               type=\"range\"\n481:               id=\"slider-ledger-digital-share\"\n482:               min=\"0\"\n483:               max=\"100\"\n484:               step=\"5\"\n485:               value=\"${digitalShare}\"\n486:               class=\"w-full accent-purple-600 cursor-pointer\"\n487:             />\n488: \n489:             <!-- Custom Profit Rates -->\n490:             <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs pt-1\">\n491:               <div>\n492:                 <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold block mb-1\">Digital Profit Rate (%) <span class=\"text-emerald-600 font-normal\">(Min 6%)</span>:</label>\n493:                 <input \n494:                   type=\"number\"\n495:                   id=\"input-ledger-digital-rate\"\n496:                   step=\"0.5\"\n497:                   value=\"${digitalRate}\"\n498:                   class=\"w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-emerald-800\"\n499:                 />\n500:               </div>\n501: \n502:               <div>\n503:                 <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold block mb-1\">Cash Profit Rate (%) <span class=\"text-amber-600 font-normal\">(Min 8%)</span>:</label>\n504:                 <input \n505:                   type=\"number\"\n506:                   id=\"input-ledger-cash-rate\"\n507:                   step=\"0.5\"\n508:                   value=\"${cashRate}\"\n509:                   class=\"w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-amber-800\"\n510:                 />\n511:               </div>\n512:             </div>\n513: \n514:             <!-- Calculation formula breakdown -->\n515:             <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-purple-100 font-mono text-xs space-y-1\">\n516:               <div class=\"flex justify-between text-slate-600\">\n517:                 <span>Digital Sales (${formatWhole(digitalSales)} × ${digitalRate}%):</span>\n518:                 <span class=\"font-bold text-emerald-700\">${formatRupees(digitalProfit)}</span>\n519:               </div>\n520:               <div class=\"flex justify-between text-slate-600\">\n521:                 <span>Cash Sales (${formatWhole(cashSales)} × ${cashRate}%):</span>\n522:                 <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-700\">${formatRupees(cashProfit)}</span>\n523:               </div>\n524:               <div class=\"flex justify-between border-t border-slate-200 pt-1 font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">\n525:                 <span>Deemed Business Net Profit:</span>\n526:                 <span class=\"text-purple-700\">${formatRupees(netTaxableProfit)}</span>\n527:               </div>\n528:             </div>\n529:           </div>\n530:         ` : `\n531:           <!-- NORMAL P&L (ITR-3) ENGINE -->\n532:           <div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-50/50 border border-blue-200 space-y-4\">\n533:             <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs\">\n534:               <!-- Purchase Costs (Auto-populated from Stored Bills Total) -->\n535:               <div>\n536:                 <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-1\">\n537:                   <label class=\"font-bold text-slate-700\">Cost of Goods / Purchase Costs (₹):</label>\n538:                   <button \n539:                     type=\"button\" \n540:                     id=\"btn-autofill-ledger-purchases\"\n541:                     class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-indigo-700 bg-indigo-50 hover:bg-indigo-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-indigo-200\"\n542:                     title=\"Populate from sum of stored bills subtotal\"\n543:                   >\n544:                     ⚡ Auto-fill Ledger (${formatWhole(totalPurchases)})\n545:                   </button>\n546:                 </div>\n547:                 <input \n548:                   type=\"number\"\n549:                   id=\"input-ledger-purchases\"\n550:                   step=\"1000\"\n551:                   value=\"${purchaseCosts}\"\n552:                   class=\"w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\"\n553:                 />\n554:               </div>\n555: \n556:               <!-- Other Operating Expenses -->\n557:               <div>\n558:                 <label class=\"font-bold text-slate-700 block mb-1\">Other Operating Expenses (Rent, Power, Salaries) (₹):</label>\n559:                 <input \n560:                   type=\"number\"\n561:                   id=\"input-ledger-opex\"\n562:                   step=\"1000\"\n563:                   value=\"${operatingExpenses}\"\n564:                   class=\"w-full bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 font-mono text-sm font-bold text-slate-900\"\n565:                 />\n566:               </div>\n567:             </div>\n568: \n569:             <!-- Calculation formula breakdown -->\n570:             <div class=\"p-3 bg-white rounded-lg border border-blue-100 font-mono text-xs space-y-1\">\n571:               <div class=\"flex justify-between text-slate-600\">\n572:                 <span>Gross Annual Sales:</span>\n573:                 <span class=\"font-bold text-slate-900\">${formatWhole(annualTurnover)}</span>\n574:               </div>\n575:               <div class=\"flex justify-between text-slate-600\">\n576:                 <span>Less Total Expenses (${formatWhole(purchaseCosts)} + ${formatWhole(operatingExpenses)}):</span>\n577:                 <span class=\"font-bold text-rose-600\">- ${formatRupees(totalExpensesRegular)}</span>\n578:               </div>\n579:               <div class=\"flex justify-between border-t border-slate-200 pt-1 font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm\">\n580:                 <span>Net Taxable Business Profit:</span>\n581:                 <span class=\"text-blue-700\">${formatRupees(netTaxableProfit)}</span>\n582:               </div>\n583:             </div>\n584:           </div>\n585:         `}\n586: \n587:         <!-- LIVE TAX LIABILITY SUMMARY & SECTION 87A REBATE -->\n588:         <div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 border border-slate-200 space-y-3\">\n589:           <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs\">\n590:             <span class=\"font-bold text-slate-700\">New Tax Regime Computation (FY 2025-26):</span>\n591:             <span class=\"font-mono text-emerald-700 font-bold\">Standard Deduction: ₹75,000 auto-applied</span>\n592:           </div>\n593: \n594:           <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs font-mono\">\n595:             <div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200\">\n596:               <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 block uppercase font-sans\">Net Taxable Income</span>\n597:               <span class=\"text-base font-bold text-slate-900\">${formatRupees(netTaxableIncome)}</span>\n598:             </div>\n599: \n600:             <div class=\"p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-white border border-slate-200\">"}
